WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:02.722
It was early Monday morning.

2
00:00:02.723 --> 00:00:06.942
Dr. Chen and General Waltz were in the lab.

3
00:00:06.943 --> 00:00:11.778
"The cure is ready." Dr. Chen showed the general a small device.

4
00:00:11.779 --> 00:00:17.915
"This sprays a mist. The mist stops the geyser's energy."

5
00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:19.730
She walked toward the cells.

6
00:00:19.731 --> 00:00:23.943
"I'll use it on Private Benson first, and then—"

7
00:00:23.944 --> 00:00:26.486
The scientist stopped.

8
00:00:26.487 --> 00:00:31.546
She looked at the general. "I think the cure is a bad idea."

9
00:00:31.547 --> 00:00:35.508
General Waltz smiled.

10
00:00:35.509 --> 00:00:39.937
*** Roxy got out of bed and

11
00:00:39.938 --> 00:00:43.164
yawned. She was still tired from spending most of the night in

12
00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:46.033
space. Her watch

13
00:00:46.034 --> 00:00:50.716
beeped. "Metro City Central Bank is being robbed!" Mayor Bloom

14
00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:54.901
said. "Maybe Brain Invader is controlling Mayor Bloom," Roxy

15
00:00:54.902 --> 00:00:58.012
thought. "But maybe not. I have to find

16
00:00:58.013 --> 00:01:03.728
out." "Don't worry," Roxy said. "I'm on my

17
00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:05.629
way!" Roxy arrived at the

18
00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.152
bank. Police officers hid behind their

19
00:01:08.153 --> 00:01:10.543
cars. Slime covered the

20
00:01:10.544 --> 00:01:12.770
cars. "Uh-oh," Roxy

21
00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:16.962
said. "Brain Invader is controlling the Mighty Man actor

22
00:01:16.963 --> 00:01:20.845
again!" Crash! A figure smashed through the bank's

23
00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:24.954
wall. Roxy's eyes went wide. "Private

24
00:01:24.955 --> 00:01:27.333
Benson!" Private Benson was holding a sack of

25
00:01:27.334 --> 00:01:29.421
money. She jumped onto a police

26
00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:33.626
car. Smash! Metal twisted. Windows

27
00:01:33.627 --> 00:01:36.370
shattered. The Mighty Man actor came out with more

28
00:01:36.371 --> 00:01:40.284
money. "Don't let Brain Invader control you!" Roxy

29
00:01:40.285 --> 00:01:41.744
shouted. The villains attacked.

30
00:01:41.745 --> 00:01:44.999
A big orange fist slammed into Roxy.

31
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.319
Slime sprayed everywhere.

32
00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:50.133
Roxy tried to fight back.

33
00:01:50.134 --> 00:01:52.475
But Brain Invader shouted in her head.

34
00:01:52.476 --> 00:01:56.707
"Obey me, Rocket Girl! Stop fighting!"

35
00:01:56.708 --> 00:01:58.811
"Ugh!" Roxy thought.

36
00:01:58.812 --> 00:02:02.471
"I can't fight all three of these villains!"

37
00:02:02.472 --> 00:02:05.489
Suddenly Private Benson grabbed Roxy and threw her.

38
00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:09.093
Bam! She landed inside an armored truck.

39
00:02:09.094 --> 00:02:11.203
Brain Invader's voice was gone.

40
00:02:11.204 --> 00:02:12.906
Roxy thought that was odd.

41
00:02:12.907 --> 00:02:15.447
Then she realized something.

42
00:02:15.448 --> 00:02:17.433
"This truck is made of steel!

43
00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:20.893
And a steel pole stopped Private Benson.

44
00:02:20.894 --> 00:02:24.567
The cells in Dr. Chen's lab are made of steel . . .

45
00:02:24.568 --> 00:02:27.845
Steel blocks Brain Invader's power!"

46
00:02:27.846 --> 00:02:31.308
Private Benson and the actor started to run away.

47
00:02:31.309 --> 00:02:34.186
"I have to stop them!" Roxy said.

48
00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.431
"Help!" a voice called out.

49
00:02:36.432 --> 00:02:39.568
Roxy spun around and saw a military truck.

50
00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:41.754
She used her x-ray vision.

51
00:02:41.755 --> 00:02:45.343
General Waltz was tied up inside!

52
00:02:45.344 --> 00:02:50.652
Roxy flew over and pulled the door open.

53
00:02:50.653 --> 00:02:55.499
She untied the general.

54
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.825
"I'm happy to see you," General Waltz said.

55
00:02:58.826 --> 00:03:02.058
"Dr. Chen was going to use the cure this morning.

56
00:03:02.059 --> 00:03:03.823
But then she refused.

57
00:03:03.824 --> 00:03:07.006
She released those villains, and they kidnapped me!"

58
00:03:07.007 --> 00:03:09.366
Roxy blinked in surprise.

59
00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:13.198
"I think she's going to take over the military," General Waltz said.

60
00:03:13.199 --> 00:03:17.914
"Maybe even the world!"

